<title>USA: Premier Ventures names chairman.</title>
<headline>Premier Ventures names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Ventures and Explorations Inc said Wednesday it had named Sean Lee as chairman and chief executive officer and that it plans to change its name to New Directions Manufacturing Inc.</p>
<p>Lee has prviously worked as the president and chief executive officer of Home Base and president of W.R. Grace Home-Centers West.</p>
<p>The company also named Donald Metke as the company's new president.</p>
<p>The firm was unavailable for further details.</p>
